      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 476,
        "height": 364,
        "content": "## Fetch 1Password audit events\nRuns every 15 minutes and pulls the last 24h of audit events from the 1Password Events API (`/api/v2/auditevents`). Requires an Events API token with the `auditevents` feature."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "cd520507-1357-41fe-acf3-1e330cbb488d",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Filter",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        400,
        -176
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 428,
        "height": 364,
        "content": "## Isolate vault exports\nSplits the events array into individual items and keeps only vault export events (`object_type = vault`, `action` contains `export`)."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "f8f72a87-a127-4a10-8355-6cfd6d719d03",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Normalize",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        864,
        -176
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 396,
        "height": 364,
        "content": "## Normalize details\nExtracts the user, vault name, timestamp and source IP (if available) for each export, plus your TheHive base URL used to build the alert link."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "2dd1742c-13cc-423b-b4c2-aae1038654ff",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Respond",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        1296,
        -176
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 460,
        "height": 364,
        "content": "## Alert & notify\nCreates a high-severity TheHive alert titled \"1Password vault export detected\" with the details in the description, then posts a Slack summary linking back to the alert."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "59065c75-71e9-4f2f-9b58-8926de9ee182",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -800,
        -320
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 656,
        "height": 624,
        "content": "# Detect 1Password Vault Exports and Create Security Alerts\n\nAutomatically monitor 1Password audit events for vault export activity, create a security alert in TheHive, and notify your team in Slack.\n\n### How it works\n\n1. The workflow runs every 15 minutes and requests recent audit events from the 1Password Events API.\n2. Events are split into individual items and filtered to keep only vault export activity.\n3. Relevant event details such as the user, email, vault, timestamp, source IP, and event ID are normalized.\n4. A TheHive alert is created with the export details and source event reference.\n5. A Slack notification is posted with the key details and a direct link to the TheHive alert.\n\n### Setup\n\n1. Connect an HTTP credential configured for the 1Password Events API.\n2. Enter your TheHive base URL in `Extract Export Details`.\n3. Connect your TheHive credentials and select the Slack channel where security alerts should be posted.\n4. Make sure the 1Password Events API token has access to the `auditevents` feature.\n5. Activate the workflow after testing with a real audit event.\n\n### Customization\n\nYou can change the polling interval, audit event lookback period, export filters, TheHive alert fields, severity, tags, and Slack notification format to match your security workflow."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    }
